{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-23","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：素数与互素与整数","englishTitle":"If two number be prime to one another, the number which measures the one of them will be prime to the remaining number.","book":7,"number":23,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.23","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.23/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":23,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-23@raw-22ddc31f1a0469d2","contentId":"euclid-7-23","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"22ddc31f1a0469d24508c71063bf18a73a9fd5e2dce87c29cfac7a7ebf02e9b7","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-23.statement","euclid-7-23.construction.1","euclid-7-23.proof.1","euclid-7-23.construction.2","euclid-7-23.proof.2","euclid-7-23.proof.3","euclid-7-23.proof.4","euclid-7-23.conclusion","euclid-7-23.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-23.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-23","revisionId":"euclid-7-23@raw-22ddc31f1a0469d2","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f6217d9983e2d0deb91a2c238a7bd5ba5b3a0b36152b8c0be915856e5d310dcd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two number be prime to one another, the number which measures the one of them will be prime to the remaining number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个号码是互素, 整除的号码 其中之一将是剩余号码的首字母。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-23.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-23","revisionId":"euclid-7-23@raw-22ddc31f1a0469d2","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e71cb2545ab390721f84522a456bdf07e24a999ee820e80ba89a2f7d7af707ab","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B be two numbers prime to one another, and let any number C measure A; I say that C, B are also prime to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B成为2号互素,让C,整除,A;我说C,B也是互素。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-23.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-23","revisionId":"euclid-7-23@raw-22ddc31f1a0469d2","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"32682a906b613ecc42034855f28968dd34c488509f62d709507a19298a5f3878","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if C, B are not prime to one another, some number will measure C, B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果C,B不是互素, 某些数字是整除,C,B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-23.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-7-23","revisionId":"euclid-7-23@raw-22ddc31f1a0469d2","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1fee6ddcda880207e422d970c4b108b6c158c2775a98efe4eb5909c96736a70c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let a number measure them, and let it be D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它们数到整除,然后D"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-23.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-23","revisionId":"euclid-7-23@raw-22ddc31f1a0469d2","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e299e0b53c537faca65df9eac62e86f3cd3ca5812d3abd547b5e517ed313a0e3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since D measures C, and C measures A, therefore D also measures A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自D 整除 C和C 整除 A以来,因此,D也是整除 A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-23.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-23","revisionId":"euclid-7-23@raw-22ddc31f1a0469d2","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"34d996373de666d995f5442d742cf14e1b5838fa7ee3ab6c3cc5e0280d57f6be","citations":["euclid-7-def-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it also measures B; therefore D measures A, B which are prime to one another: which is impossible. [[VII. Def. 12](/principles/euclid-7-def-12)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它也整除 B; 因此,D 整除 A,B, 也就是互素: 这是不可能的。 [[VII. Def. 12](/principles/euclid-7-def-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-23.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-7-23","revisionId":"euclid-7-23@raw-22ddc31f1a0469d2","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"590f2cde2b34eda74a5b5dc488ed8f2a60e839be7ff73e9bf10179f32b4e3495","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore no number will measure the numbers C, B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,没有号码整除 C,B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-23.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-23","revisionId":"euclid-7-23@raw-22ddc31f1a0469d2","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6a5dcffe8f94721db99092a889a9d0f8a480af9a0c2c5ed4849970a6e52b1127","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore C, B are prime to one another. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,C,B是互素。 Q. E,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-23.source","contentId":"euclid-7-23","revisionId":"euclid-7-23@raw-22ddc31f1a0469d2","order":8,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"06fe268a94e7ef2d6afbb774b4fbb113a59ca6e17cf8480083e17500ac5d35fc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.23/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.23\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-23:euclid-7-def-12:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-23","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-23.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-def-12","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.23","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.23/","sourceLabel":"VII. Def. 12"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-24:euclid-7-23:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-24","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-24.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-23","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.24","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.24/","sourceLabel":"VII. 23"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-7-23:euclid-7-def-12:explicit","id":"euclid-7-def-12","book":7,"number":12,"kind":"definition","title":"互素整数：公约数只有单位","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-7-24:euclid-7-23:explicit","id":"euclid-7-24","book":7,"number":24,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：整数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-number","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
